OL,3,GNEWSAPundit and ex-rugby player cleared
OL,4,Aof sex assault                         
OL,6,FA TV pundit and former England rugby   
OL,7,Fleague player has been cleared of      
OL,8,Fsexually assaulting a woman by putting 
OL,9,Fher hand up her skirt in a cricket club
OL,10,Ftoilet.                                
OL,12,FDanika Priim, 42, had been accused of  
OL,13,Fassaulting the woman at Horsforth      
OL,14,FCricket Club in Leeds in July 2022 but 
OL,15,Fwas found not guilty following a       
OL,16,Fthree-day trial at Leeds Crown Court on
OL,17,FThursday.                              
OL,19,FSpeaking after the verdict, Priim, who 
OL,20,Fplayed for the Bradford Bulls and Leeds
OL,21,FRhinos, said the allegation had taken  
OL,22,Fits toll.                              
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
